# Files that live in `dist/` but must never be served as public assets.
#
# `astro build` with the Cloudflare adapter emits the Pages-style
# `dist/_worker.js/` bundle and `dist/_routes.json`. The Worker entrypoint is
# referenced through `main` in `wrangler.jsonc`; uploading it as an asset would
# expose the server-side bundle to the public Internet, so wrangler refuses the
# deploy unless it is listed here.
_worker.js
_routes.json
